### VS Code "REST Client" extension file. Click "Send Request" above any request.
@base = http://localhost:5000/api

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### List (first page, newest added first)
GET {{base}}/movies

### Search + filters + sort + pagination
GET {{base}}/movies?search=inter&genre=Sci-Fi,Drama&min_rating=7.5&year_min=2000&sort=rating&order=desc&page=1&limit=20

### One movie with cast / directors / platforms
GET {{base}}/movies/1

### Create a movie
POST {{base}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Example Movie",
  "release_year": 2024,
  "genre": "Drama, Thriller",
  "imdb_rating": 8.2,
  "runtime": 120,
  "age_rating": "PG-13",
  "language": "English",
  "ott_platform": "Netflix",
  "description": "Example description",
  "poster_url": null
}

### Validation failure (expect 400 with per-field errors)
POST {{base}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "", "release_year": 1700, "imdb_rating": 11 }

### Lookups
GET {{base}}/genres
###
GET {{base}}/languages
###
GET {{base}}/platforms
###
GET {{base}}/stats
